Subject: XDM not creating login shells
Message-ID: <1994Mar25.141030.8598@ed8200.ped.pto.ford.com>
Sender: news@ed8200.ped.pto.ford.com (USENET News System)
Nntp-Posting-Host: pt9233.ped.pto.ford.com
