Here a short list of the switches:

Memory Addressing Ranges (0=off,1=on):

Buffer  SW1  SW2  SW3  SW4  Memory Addressing
Size                        Range

64KB    1    1    1    1    C0000-CFFFF
        1    0    1    1    D0000-DFFFF (Default)
        0    1    1    1    E0000-EFFFF (not on all PCs)

32KB    1    1    0    0    C8000-CFFFF
        1    0    0    0    D8000-DFFFF
        0    1    0    0    E8000-EFFFF (not on all PCs)

I/O Address Selection:

SW5 = on  = 300 - 30F  (Default)
    = off = 200 - 20F


Remote Boot:

SW6 = on   = Disabled  (Default)
    = off  = Enabled

Remote Boot Timeout:

SW7 = off  = 30 seconds (Default)
    = on   = 150 seconds

Interrupt Request Line Selection (SW8 - SW12):

SW8	IRQ5  (default)
SW9	IRQ9
SW10    IRQ10
SW11	IRQ11
SW12	IRQ15


Hope that helps

