Digital didn't worked on an integration between Logical Volume Manager (LVM)
and Advanced File System (ADVFS) until now. 

The main effort of Digital are put to have an integration between ADVFS, LSM 
(Logical Storage Management) and DECSafe Available Server (ASE).

The global picture is the following :

	- Logical Storage Management (LSM)
		- Disk concatenation 
		- Disk mirroring
		- Disk Striping
