Actually, he'd probably say "directory, which you can abbriviate to D-I-R".

}Sixpack: "Hu-what?" 
}
}sysadmin: (condescendingly), "It's just like English, you know, Dee-Eye-Aar
}for *diiiirectory**??"
}
}(OK, I exaggerate)

