definitly more logical than "ls" - now, if it was actually "list" rather
then the Martian eqivalent, it might be considered just as logical.

Besides, if you know that files are stored in directories you might pick
"directory" as one of your commands.

At least under VMS you could enter "help" and get help.  Just looking at the
