can't be done for under (say) 50% the cost of a new drive," we're in the
position of converting at >50% cost, since we can't justify buying a new
tape drive with the money we have.  The projects that use the Kennedy's
have enough $$ only for maintenance, not big upgrades, unless I can make an
iron-clad argument that there's absolutely no other way.  

